    "created_at": "2018-03-15T07:34:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-03-15T07:34:25Z",
    "body": "I think that has the same issues he's worried about. Namely that introducing new ways to create elements has security implications and even if all browsers updated it's unclear if servers would.",
